1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 19=

10
00:01:15,110 --> 00:01:15,660
Master.

11
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:22,340
Li.

12
00:01:24,990 --> 00:01:26,750
Why do you look like a little girl
who's done something wrong?

13
00:01:27,270 --> 00:01:28,380
You're even feeling shy now.

14
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:31,940
I did do something wrong.

15
00:01:33,110 --> 00:01:34,110
What did you do wrong?

16
00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:45,710
Look at me.

17
00:01:52,830 --> 00:01:54,150
You imprisoned me

18
00:01:54,790 --> 00:01:57,030
because you deeply hated those
who destroyed your family.

19
00:01:57,940 --> 00:01:58,790
But after uncovering the truth,

20
00:01:58,830 --> 00:02:00,150
you wanted to clear my name

21
00:02:00,470 --> 00:02:02,540
because you've learned to keep
that hatred under control

22
00:02:03,390 --> 00:02:04,230
without letting it

23
00:02:04,230 --> 00:02:06,110
blind you or cloud your judgment.

24
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:08,830
Now that's the disciple
I taught you to be.

25
00:02:16,420 --> 00:02:16,980
All right.

26
00:02:18,830 --> 00:02:20,420
Now that your third enemy
has revealed himself,

27
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:23,900
what do you plan to do?

28
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:27,900
Master.

29
00:02:29,230 --> 00:02:30,340
For the moment,

30
00:02:31,870 --> 00:02:32,950
I don't know where to begin.

31
00:02:33,830 --> 00:02:35,030
With your heart consumed by love,

32
00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:36,950
it's only natural that you
can't think everything through.

33
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:40,260
You've certainly gone to great lengths

34
00:02:40,670 --> 00:02:41,980
to help Shen Li
carry out her plan for revenge.

35
00:02:42,340 --> 00:02:44,140
Her vendetta is mine as well.

36
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:45,830
Xiao Jing

37
00:02:46,870 --> 00:02:47,670
must be eliminated.

38
00:02:53,230 --> 00:02:54,950
This is the epidemic
poison formula I copied.

39
00:02:55,470 --> 00:02:56,950
(Epidemic Poison Formula)
Xiao Jing used this formula

40
00:02:57,540 --> 00:02:58,510
to create the poison soldiers.

41
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:00,980
This formula

42
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:03,140
is meant to be tested on living people?

43
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:09,300
Can you take us
to see those poison soldiers?

44
00:03:15,070 --> 00:03:15,540
All right.

45
00:03:26,670 --> 00:03:28,540
This drug is called Fleeting Dream.

46
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:31,190
Once taken,
all signs of life will disappear.

47
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:33,350
You'll awaken
on your own three days later.

48
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:34,670
By then,

49
00:03:35,260 --> 00:03:36,260
the palace will be far behind you,

50
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:38,110
and you'll finally be free
to go wherever you please.

51
00:03:40,110 --> 00:03:41,460
Rongyin, where should we go?

52
00:03:42,830 --> 00:03:44,070
Let's go to Jiangnan.

53
00:03:45,110 --> 00:03:46,460
Wherever you go, I'm going with you.

54
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:47,980
You'll never get rid of me.

55
00:03:48,140 --> 00:03:48,950
So clingy.

56
00:03:59,070 --> 00:03:59,950
(These poison soldiers)

57
00:04:00,350 --> 00:04:01,460
(have swollen purple veins,)

58
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:03,950
(flesh festering like rotten taro,)

59
00:04:04,020 --> 00:04:05,140
(rasping sounds coming
from their throats,)

60
00:04:06,350 --> 00:04:08,230
(dilated, unfocused pupils,)

61
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:09,950
(and bodies
resembling the walking dead.)

62
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:12,580
Can they even be called human anymore?

63
00:04:13,070 --> 00:04:14,110
They're not human.

64
00:04:14,580 --> 00:04:15,460
They're monsters.

65
00:04:16,140 --> 00:04:18,230
They feel no pain and fear no death.

66
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:19,420
Even blades can barely harm them.

67
00:04:19,910 --> 00:04:22,140
On the battlefield,
they're indestructible puppets.

68
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:23,300
You two, go over there.

69
00:04:23,790 --> 00:04:24,420
- Yes.
- Yes.

70
00:04:24,910 --> 00:04:26,420
Xiao Jing comes to inspect
this place every night.

71
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:27,910
We shouldn't stay here long.

72
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:37,070
(Since these poison soldiers
were created with poison,)

73
00:04:37,830 --> 00:04:39,510
(perhaps another poison
could be used to counter it.)

74
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:50,700
Stop.

75
00:04:56,390 --> 00:04:57,670
I don't recognize either of you.

76
00:04:58,630 --> 00:04:59,350
Are you new here?

77
00:05:05,740 --> 00:05:06,420
General,

78
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:09,260
we were transferred
to the kitchen just yesterday.

79
00:05:12,990 --> 00:05:14,750
Transferred to the kitchen?

80
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:18,190
General,

81
00:05:21,140 --> 00:05:22,830
I've been waiting
for you for quite some time.

82
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:24,310
I grew hungry,

83
00:05:24,750 --> 00:05:25,900
so I sent the two of them out

84
00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:27,660
to buy me something from the market.

85
00:05:32,780 --> 00:05:33,660
If you're hungry,

86
00:05:34,390 --> 00:05:35,870
you could simply
have the kitchen prepare something.

87
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:37,390
Why go all that way?

88
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:42,190
After spending so much time with me,

89
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:44,750
you still don't know what I crave?

90
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:49,780
Then what do you like to eat?

91
00:05:51,020 --> 00:05:51,990
I

92
00:05:53,550 --> 00:05:54,430
like to devour people.

93
00:05:57,140 --> 00:05:57,870
You little tease.

94
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:00,390
General,

95
00:06:01,070 --> 00:06:04,430
I have wonderful news for you.

96
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:07,750
General,

97
00:06:10,140 --> 00:06:11,140
you're going to be a father.

98
00:06:16,220 --> 00:06:16,700
Really?

99
00:06:23,020 --> 00:06:24,190
I'm going to be a father?

100
00:06:24,510 --> 00:06:25,780
The Xiao family finally has an heir!

101
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:27,070
Put me down.

102
00:06:27,070 --> 00:06:27,780
This is wonderful!

103
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:29,510
The Xiao family finally has an heir!

104
00:06:30,750 --> 00:06:31,700
Put me down!

105
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:42,340
It took Xiao Jing three years

106
00:06:42,660 --> 00:06:43,750
to create the poison soldiers.

107
00:06:44,870 --> 00:06:48,190
We can't expect to find
a way to stop them overnight.

108
00:06:51,140 --> 00:06:52,750
The sudden epidemic
around the Capital back then

109
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:53,830
was no natural disaster.

110
00:06:53,950 --> 00:06:54,830
It was deliberately caused.

111
00:06:55,310 --> 00:06:56,700
It must have been connected

112
00:06:56,950 --> 00:06:58,070
to Xiao Jing's creation
of the poison soldiers.

113
00:06:58,580 --> 00:07:00,020
The riverworks overseen by Lord Ju

114
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:02,900
and the frontier guarded
by Xiao Jing share the same waterway.

115
00:07:03,310 --> 00:07:04,750
If poison was released into the water,

116
00:07:05,390 --> 00:07:06,550
it would flow straight
into the Capital region.

117
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:10,460
So Xiao Jing was behind this.

118
00:07:11,430 --> 00:07:12,830
I'll kill him with my own hands!

119
00:07:27,660 --> 00:07:28,310
General.

120
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,870
Did you have a nightmare?

121
00:07:41,340 --> 00:07:42,220
Haitang, do you know

122
00:07:43,580 --> 00:07:45,100
why I created the poison soldiers?

123
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:48,260
If you wish to tell me,

124
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:51,510
I'm willing to listen.

125
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:55,900
Ever since
I was old enough to understand,

126
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:59,460
Father was the greatest hero
in my heart.

127
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:03,140
In the army, he was
an undefeated God of War revered by all.

128
00:08:05,550 --> 00:08:06,780
He had never lost a battle in his life,

129
00:08:10,780 --> 00:08:11,700
except that one time.

130
00:08:13,700 --> 00:08:15,020
Just that once.

131
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:16,550
Great General Xiao,

132
00:08:17,070 --> 00:08:18,870
where's that mighty spirit of yours now?

133
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:20,750
If you're going to kill me, then do it.

134
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:22,340
Spare me the taunts.

135
00:08:22,510 --> 00:08:23,190
Fine.

136
00:08:23,650 --> 00:08:24,190
Father!

137
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:26,190
Today, I'll take your head, Xiao Shiqi,

138
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:27,510
and use it as an offering
before my battle standard.

139
00:08:31,990 --> 00:08:32,870
- The moment I saw him
- Spare no one!

140
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:34,700
killed by the enemy with my own eyes,

141
00:08:35,430 --> 00:08:36,310
I swore

142
00:08:36,900 --> 00:08:38,260
I would never lose a battle in my life!

143
00:08:41,070 --> 00:08:43,990
Now that I have a family

144
00:08:44,830 --> 00:08:45,830
and will soon be a father,

145
00:08:46,990 --> 00:08:48,220
I want to set an example for our child,

146
00:08:48,870 --> 00:08:50,630
one of a man who never loses.

147
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:53,310
I want him to know

148
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:54,340
that his father

149
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:58,020
is an invincible great general.

150
00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:07,990
In my heart,

151
00:09:09,190 --> 00:09:11,780
whether you're a general

152
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:13,510
or an ordinary man,

153
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:17,390
I'll stay by your side
for the rest of my life

154
00:09:17,990 --> 00:09:18,990
and raise a family with you.

155
00:09:22,750 --> 00:09:23,260
General.

156
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:25,070
I have urgent news to report.

157
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:30,430
Be careful.

158
00:09:32,220 --> 00:09:33,740
Go to sleep. Don't wait for me.

159
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:40,860
Be careful.

160
00:09:52,310 --> 00:09:52,740
General.

161
00:09:53,310 --> 00:09:53,980
Since this afternoon,

162
00:09:54,430 --> 00:09:55,580
the poison soldiers
have all been growling,

163
00:09:55,910 --> 00:09:56,740
their eyes turning red

164
00:09:56,910 --> 00:09:57,670
as they bite at their chains.

165
00:09:58,310 --> 00:09:59,790
The entire camp is in turmoil.

166
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:01,380
And they

167
00:10:02,380 --> 00:10:03,830
don't seem to recognize
our own men anymore.

168
00:10:14,380 --> 00:10:14,860
Stop.

169
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:18,310
General,

170
00:10:19,030 --> 00:10:21,460
we were transferred
to the kitchen just yesterday.

171
00:10:27,460 --> 00:10:28,580
(Shen Li.)

172
00:10:29,830 --> 00:10:31,500
(They've completely lost)

173
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:33,220
(their senses and feel no pain.)

174
00:10:34,430 --> 00:10:36,030
(It's Mafei Powder
mixed with Corpse Gu.)

175
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:39,030
(If realgar is used to suppress the Gu,)

176
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:40,670
(and rehmannia root to cool the blood,)

177
00:10:41,910 --> 00:10:43,340
(then one more ingredient...)

178
00:11:10,580 --> 00:11:13,440
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

179
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:17,140
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

180
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:20,620
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

181
00:11:21,470 --> 00:11:24,460
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

182
00:11:25,310 --> 00:11:28,630
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

183
00:11:28,970 --> 00:11:32,260
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

184
00:11:32,610 --> 00:11:39,090
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

185
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:46,970
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

186
00:11:49,470 --> 00:11:57,320
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

187
00:11:57,620 --> 00:11:59,430
♪I stand here today♪

188
00:11:59,570 --> 00:12:04,080
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

189
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:11,570
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

190
00:12:12,210 --> 00:12:13,500
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

191
00:12:13,500 --> 00:12:15,900
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

192
00:12:16,340 --> 00:12:23,190
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
